    "discipline": "Mechanical",
    "subject": "Dynamics, Kinematics and Vibrations",
    "chapter": "Newton's Second Law- Rigid Bodies",
    "topic": "Mass Radius of Gyration",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<p>mass radius of gyration\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$r = \\sqrt{\\dfrac{I}{m}}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 111</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\nwhere, <span class=\"math display\">\\[\\begin{aligned} r &amp;= \\mathrm{mass\\ radius\\ of\\ gyration,}\\\\ I &amp;= \\mathrm{mass\\ moment\\ of\\ inertia,}\\\\ m &amp;= \\mathrm{mass\\ of\\ the\\ body} \\end{aligned}\\]</span></p>",
    "important": "",
