    "content_html": "<h5><span><b>Point Load at Center:</b></span></h5>\r\n<center><img src=\"https://onedrive.live.com/embed?resid=9C913AE725AFDEB1%21639&authkey=%21ADrZZepzhz_VPgQ&width=244&height=629\" width=\"244\" height=\"629\" /></center>\r\n\r\n<h5><span><b>Point Load Anywhere:</b></span></h5>\r\n<center><img src=\"https://onedrive.live.com/embed?resid=9C913AE725AFDEB1%21638&authkey=%21AIW6ouUXH2fU568&width=247&height=709\" width=\"247\" height=\"709\" /></center>\r\n\r\n<h5><span><b>With UDL:</b></span></h5>\r\n\r\n<center><img src=\"https://onedrive.live.com/embed?resid=9C913AE725AFDEB1%21641&authkey=%21AFC-CEgaNcFB_yY&width=275&height=739\" width=\"275\" height=\"739\" /></center>",
