    "discipline": "Mechanical",
    "subject": "Mechanics of Materials",
    "chapter": "Mohr's Circle",
    "topic": "Mohr's Circle",
    "subtopic": "Mohr's Circle",
    "content_html": "<div class=\"notes-image-container my-4 text-center flex flex-col items-center\"><center><p><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/04/Figura_3..jpg\" style=\"max-width: 50vh;\"></p><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Figura_3..jpg\">Alcaraz.acevedo</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons<br/></small></small></center></div><ol>\r\n\t<li>Draw normal and shear axes with positive axes.</li>\r\n\t<li>Mark normal stress values with sign convention, tensile stress is positive and compression stress is negative.</li>\r\n\t<li>Draw shear stress values starting from already marked normal stress points.</li>\r\n\t<li>Connect end of shear stress lines.</li>\r\n\t<li>Draw Mohr’s circle assuming the connection line as diameter of the circle.</li>\r\n\t<li>Stress Analysis on Mohr’s circle - To get normal and shear stress values at any plane at an angle $\\theta$, take angle two times <span class=\"math inline\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> in Mohr’s circle starting from diagonal of the circle and locate a peripheral point. Shear stress value will be Y axis value and normal stress value will be X axis value.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\nLet C be the x-coordinate of the center and R be the radius value of the Mohr's circle.\r\n\\begin{align*}\r\n\\sigma_{max} &= C + R\\\\\r\n\\sigma_{min} &= C - R\\\\\r\n\\tau_{max} &= R\r\n\\end{align*}",
    "important": "Axial:\r\n\\[\\sigma_1 = C + R\\]\r\n\\[\\sigma_3 = C - R\\]\r\n\r\nShear:\r\n\\[\\sigma_2 = R\\]",
    "resources": "<div class=\"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Uo8NFwAHy4v9eMdYoekYDjnd-rolHLr3/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/40 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-blue-200 transition-colors\">📄 Homework</a><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1C6UR-5ujWIep7IPNSab8skzYGi2-Xnox/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/40 text-green-700 dark:text-green-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-green-200 transition-colors\">✅ Solution</a><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ftcQuBUlwBhqfIbaL-Qex4RM68JibgJH/preview\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/40 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-purple-200 transition-colors\">👨‍🏫 Tutoring</a></div>",
