    "topic": "Lewis Equation",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\\sigma = \\dfrac{W_tP}{FY}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 437</span></button>\r\n</div><br/> \r\n\r\nwhere\r\nP = $\\dfrac{N}{d}$ =  diameter pitch (teeth/mm)<br/>\r\nF = face width (mm)<br/>\r\nY = Lewis form factor<br/>",
