    "chapter": "GD and T",
    "topic": "GD and T",
    "subtopic": "GD and T",
    "content_html": "<div class=\"container\">\r\n\t<div class=\"row align-items-start\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"col-8\">\r\n<img src=\"https://onedrive.live.com/embed?resid=9C913AE725AFDEB1%21597&authkey=%21ANj9AK9frcdTzlg&width=600\" width=\"600\" />\r\n\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n    \t\t<div class=\"col\">\r\n     <center><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e0/Prostopadlosc_I.png\" alt=\"Example of Feature Control Frame\" width=\"340\"><br/>\r\n\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Prostopadlosc_I.png\">Kamil Węglarz</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/>\r\n    \t\t</div>\r\n  \t</div>\r\n</div>",
